  "body": "Daisy Walker deck only. Advanced. Uses (3 books).\n⚡ During a skill test on a non-weakness treachery being performed by an investigator at your location, exhaust Daisy's Tote Bag and spend 1 book: That investigator gets +2 skill value for that test.\n➡️: Replenish 1 book token on Daisy’s Tote Bag and ready it.",
